        "- **ALTERNATIVE (pick 1):** selector WRP | Mag+ | random per pruning decision (paper centers WRP-vs-Mag+); K auto {2,4} vs forced; P budget per run. Removal itself is destructive per copy - always prune a deepcopy, never the trained original.",
        "- **NEVER-SAME-PATH:** pruning blocks 0 / L-1 (guarded: first+last protected); pruned-model numbers cited as dense-model numbers; Mag+ first-4+last-2 guard read as WRP's guard (different: first+last only).",
