        "## 28. External benchmark suites (download-backed live runs)\n",
        "\n",
        "Real runs on the compiled notebook model: MMLU 5-shot letter-likelihood, GSM8K 8-shot greedy EM, MBPP executed pass@1, TruthfulQA MC1/MC2, HaluEval and FaithDial pairwise likelihood, OlympiadBench gold-vs-perturbed, and a single-pass RULER-style NIAH sweep (lengths beyond the compiled ctx are skipped-with-reason; long-range coverage stays with the ConvMem runner). Pair with `Vocab::gpt2bpe` + `Scale::gpt2_124m` for suite-scale capacity (768/12/12, self-trained via §9), or run them on any selection - provenance prints the tokenizer chosen and exactly what the weights are (no external checkpoint is ever loaded by this notebook). Offline each suite returns `{\"error\": ...}` (SKIP), never a fabricated number.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
